{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477710/extras/956b05b94a781183e2a39d13fdbda2af.avif?t=1768785978\" alt=\"Built to Scale Solitaire logo\" width=1280 height=370 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a load off your mind with\u00a0<strong>Built to Scale Solitaire</strong>, a uniquely designed card game about building a musical scale, inspired by Zachtronics' solitaire games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASSEMBLE:</strong>\u00a0Stack cards in ascending order by suit, but take care around the Widget cards which need to be<i> assembled</i>\u00a0in a free cell!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD SCALES:</strong>\u00a0Each card sent to the foundation is part of a scale. Arrange your cards right and they'll all fall into place automatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TUNES TO SOLVE TO:</strong>\u00a0Jam out to original music written by GenericArrangements! Warning: they're\u00a0<i>very</i>\u00a0catchy...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HD TEXTURES:</strong>\u00a0Play with new, 4K-ready card textures, or switch back to classic textures at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STATS &amp; ACHIEVEMENTS:</strong>\u00a0Track your best (and worst) games with built-in stats and earn Steam Achievements.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Built to Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477710/f0b75696b998add3aaa0cf7078996466bc18c082.jpg"},{"name":"Built to Last","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477710/796681a4573929c5400716854b1e26d5c7107aa0.jpg"},{"name":"Built to Scale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477710/b322b263e3486fd702ab2657e376a4ae8731b5cf.jpg"},{"name":"Selection Sorter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477710/36f5470e60c42efd6ba51e11650561ecd1a97db6.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Sorter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477710/165579220ff0d201144a7aee55142e2417f84e4b.jpg"},{"name":"Tall Order","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477710/cc2ccb5e8162b1dc975f5601f420d27e5b89b4a9.jpg"},{"name":"Private Parking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477710/28a1278e393c92d5854901b1a465b7210d3d66bf.jpg"},{"name":"Little Endian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477710/4a5e6bc3e7b361ba595b9a75d4ec1ffe83382b08.jpg"},{"name":"Colour Coordinated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477710/6a699cbd94e5d7c1609252b0acf2ea24b588ec60.jpg"},{"name":"Jackpot!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3477710/716079a85140028485a2f6a993869a4170bec73a.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3477710?t=1768785978","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477710/be4174026509b45b5d1c51311ac6a43569764249/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768785978","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477710/b5336c8a0afca4186f161b1f7d4041037d5bf449/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768785978","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477710/b5336c8a0afca4186f161b1f7d4041037d5bf449/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768785978","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":6